{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0183_1005_003mik", "source_sha256": "492a26e5d6d5aa520d15904ea2a435cf31f4964f2d9a85a9f42a1fbf482b18aa", "ja": "ねえ、{$P$}。\n次の撮影って、すぐに始められない？", "zh": "喂，{$P$}。\n下一组拍摄，不能马上开始吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
