{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0183_1007_p", "source_sha256": "a04f17c4973fc8b3fe994e5982fdbf1464d42453fd90632c07d51d1001ec814a", "ja": "うーん……これでも早く進行してるからな。\nそれに、撮影がはじまってから休憩とってないだろう？", "zh": "嗯……就算这样，进度也已经很快了。再说，从开始拍摄到现在都没休息过吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0183_1008_003mik", "source_sha256": "9870416767534b97e81b68ab143dfb180d8587311d7382dee7ccc45b595a5b8b", "ja": "ミキなら平気なの。それに、\nお仕事が早く終わったら、みんなうれしいでしょ？", "zh": "美希没问题的。而且，工作早点结束的话，大家都会高兴吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0183_1009_p", "source_sha256": "62fb2d60b6cc234dec8977aa420c7f44fac8a7bdd3f5f201652d36b703db9747", "ja": "それは、そうなんだけど……。なあ、美希。\nどうしてそんなに急いで撮影したいんだ？", "zh": "话虽如此……喂，美希。\n为什么这么急着拍摄？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0183_1010_003mik", "source_sha256": "9c8a2bf4e07f9f63f33e944082d023c48fd3beca189bbe6b0585c56202d8f49b", "ja": "？　{$P$}は、いっぱい\nミキのこと考えて、この衣装を選んだんでしょ？", "zh": "？ {$P$}是认真考虑了美希，才选了这套服装吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0183_1011_003mik", "source_sha256": "3645076b1a2b3108adcd94b272d341c8cea8b0a852a39ea00b04a63348b4ca77", "ja": "それがね、すっごくうれしいの☆\nだから、ミキ……いっぱい頑張りたくて。", "zh": "这让美希特别开心☆\n所以，美希……想要更加努力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
