{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0183_1013_003mik", "source_sha256": "d4a0825aa42c81bc3493bfc5a3ce66c21b81887a0dcc7b55e5b5f384bea017ef", "ja": "でも休憩したら、頑張れなく\nなっちゃうかもしれないでしょ？", "zh": "可是休息之后，说不定就没法继续努力了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0183_1014_p", "source_sha256": "66490a27faaa8b3ce73c1aab33ac6697c6126195c736220eae4ef12b3257eef3", "ja": "しまった、やる気に制限時間が！\nでも、スタッフさん達は休憩が必要だからな……。", "zh": "糟糕，干劲居然还有时限！\n不过，工作人员们也需要休息啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0183_1015_p", "source_sha256": "36fc957c72195e5108d12cec1c3704153071678944565f4b8a48a250f7529705", "ja": "うーん……それじゃあ、\n休憩時間を使って、ポーズの練習でもするか。", "zh": "嗯……那就利用休息时间，练习一下姿势吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
