{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0183_1017_p", "source_sha256": "521343a87b9734c16d22521087b617167f1ea68446ca37f566440c6eab80b91c", "ja": "えっ。ま、まあ、そうなる……かな？\nでも、これは客観的に見た時の練習で……。", "zh": "诶。呃，嗯，应该算是这样……吧？\n不过，这是练习从客观角度来看……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0183_1018_003mik", "source_sha256": "58ade12464b1231496ce336098927b43e753d76b9ededbb1406789bb12caea0b", "ja": "個人的でも全然いいよ♪　{$P$}が\n好きになってくれるような写真にしたいから～。", "zh": "只要是个人风格也完全没问题♪因为我想拍出能让{$P$}喜欢上的照片嘛～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
